DTSTART:20260914T115457Z
DTEND:20260914T132220Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 17:26:57 and reappears at 18:50:39 IST\, se
 en from Thiruvananthapuram.\nThe Moon is 42° up in the WSW · daylight\, 
 Sun +13°.\nTimes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view
  at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Thiruv
 ananthapuram
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Thiruvananthapuram
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:The Moon occults Venus
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
